# PF-1 spike: everything the spike downloads beside PF-0's pins (../pins.env), each pinned.
# Release digests are the ones GitHub states for the assets; Lean 4.15.0's assets carry none, so
# for that one release the digest a run sees is recorded, not checked. Nothing named here is
# committed to the repository.

# Lean releases: LEAN__<version>__<rid>=<asset> <sha256 or ->
LEAN__4.36.0__linux-x64=lean-4.36.0-linux.tar.zst 2b7ab1ed8b92d2e6abfaf41344823b510064dbc9c0260cac73eb496ab2dea6eb
LEAN__4.36.0__linux-arm64=lean-4.36.0-linux_aarch64.tar.zst 35471998152191ef809418ce5bf61f8fc5f209e5e3be05b48bdc4949fdb3e726
